        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A furniture manufacturer in Bangladesh with a large showroom network and a website that sent every visitor to a generic contact form."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Google Ads sent people to the home page. The enquiry form asked eleven questions. Nobody knew which showroom a lead was near, so follow-up took days."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Campaigns split by product line and city, each landing on the right range page",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Showroom finder with 'book a visit' on every product page",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Enquiry form cut from eleven fields to four, with the nearest showroom chosen for the visitor",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Call tracking by campaign",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Weekly reporting by showroom so the sales team saw its own leads",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Showroom visit bookings and enquiries rose 240% in six months, and the cost per enquiry fell by more than half."
        }
      ]
    },
